# Ophira IOC list - one indicator per line, # comments allowed
# Auto-detected types:
#   SHA1 (40 hex)  - checked against amcache execution history
#   SHA256/MD5 (64/32 hex) - checked against running processes
#   IPv4 addresses - checked against live connections
#   domains (matched with subdomains) - checked against DNS cache
#
# Examples:
# 6f3be2a0e5f8f9c60d2b1c0a19e8d7c6b5a43210
# 185.220.101.4
# evil-c2.example.com
